  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who hold or are exposed to misogynistic, Islamophobic, and welfare dependency tropes. The meme is designed to appeal to those who believe women, particularly Muslim women, are undeserving of social benefits and who view military sacrifice as morally superior to receiving government aid. The visual of the woman in a hijab is used to trigger stereotypes of Muslim women as oppressed or greedy, while the juxtaposition with the man’s death invokes gender-based value judgments that men are more deserving. The intended audience likely includes people who support or are influenced by these prejudiced worldviews, and who may be motivated to share or engage with the meme to reinforce their biases or to attack individuals perceived as receiving undeserved aid.",
